# Normalise every text file to LF in the working tree on all platforms.
# Without this, a Windows checkout produces CRLF while CI on Linux produces LF,
# and `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` fails on one of them regardless of
# which line ending .editorconfig declares.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
